it=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e01bd8ab73624ee52a2545a40dd9175, https://si.imgix.net/fb393c1f/uploads/origins/c0db7ff1-9895-4406-8b55-54b573c76d30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=37e6cda37b27fc95eb66556964119ebc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fb393c1f/uploads/origins/c0db7ff1-9895-4406-8b55-54b573c76d30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02dbd1a70601221cb88329f4f5747b8e 3x"}, "body": "Hello there, I would like to request my character Saphru the Unholy Angel. I have provided her references in the link for you. Please draw her wings as big as they are in the reference. I have provided a few images of some expressions I would like as well, I would like an alternate expression of desolation as well.  I would like the image to be wide please. I provided a couple images with some scenes I enjoy. I like the feeling of a desolate battlefield, with some sorrow in their eyes. I would like the scene to be similar to those two, please no futuristic objects/ technology. If you are comfortable, please draw some armored bodies scattered on the ground. I would like the area to be a forest setting, but in a field area. So there will be trees surrounding, and a big open space in the middle. Could you add birds circling in the air as well. I would like there to be a some blood involved, showing that Saphru was fighting. The last image I provided is a color scheme of yours that I enjoy, if you would like to do something similar to that please feel free. If you think other colors would suit the scene better, please do that instead. I would also like for you to design her a sword, I provided a reference image with a design I enjoy. I would like the hilt to be silver, and the blade to be glass. Feel free to make it one or two handed. I look forwards to working with you! Thank you for reading my request.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/boqR7yE", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": 